    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At a lone island in the middle of a lake at the edge of the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a calamity is spreading...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you work with your friends to dispel the gloom shrouding the island,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or venture alone to uncover the source of the disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you choose, you must act quickly\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for when midnight arrives, there will be no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/59fe1fc1af9998d54858d4f28755997f.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/59fe1fc1af9998d54858d4f28755997f.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/59fe1fc1af9998d54858d4f28755997f.mp4?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You realize tonight is the final night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse this stylized world through point-and-click exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/4e9ac53e40b33fbabeeb3d1ec30b14e2.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/4e9ac53e40b33fbabeeb3d1ec30b14e2.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/4e9ac53e40b33fbabeeb3d1ec30b14e2.mp4?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to fend off beasts, mutated fish, and even bandits,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >surviving in turn-based combat with a &quot;distance&quot; mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/e889225a8cba6a45f5fc55fa1ed381b6.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/e889225a8cba6a45f5fc55fa1ed381b6.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/e889225a8cba6a45f5fc55fa1ed381b6.mp4?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/ad1fa3a1fedd24ad51778a41766ebcd8.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/ad1fa3a1fedd24ad51778a41766ebcd8.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use precious resources to craft tools or barter for supplies\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all while racing against time to uncover the source of the catastrophe.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At a lone island in the middle of a lake at the edge of the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a calamity is spreading...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you work with your friends to dispel the gloom shrouding the island,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or venture alone to uncover the source of the disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you choose, you must act quickly\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for when midnight arrives, there will be no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/59fe1fc1af9998d54858d4f28755997f.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/59fe1fc1af9998d54858d4f28755997f.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/59fe1fc1af9998d54858d4f28755997f.mp4?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You realize tonight is the final night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse this stylized world through point-and-click exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/4e9ac53e40b33fbabeeb3d1ec30b14e2.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/4e9ac53e40b33fbabeeb3d1ec30b14e2.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/4e9ac53e40b33fbabeeb3d1ec30b14e2.mp4?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have to fend off beasts, mutated fish, and even bandits,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >surviving in turn-based combat with a &quot;distance&quot; mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/e889225a8cba6a45f5fc55fa1ed381b6.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/e889225a8cba6a45f5fc55fa1ed381b6.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/e889225a8cba6a45f5fc55fa1ed381b6.mp4?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/ad1fa3a1fedd24ad51778a41766ebcd8.poster.avif?t=1747706032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713330/extras/ad1fa3a1fedd24ad51778a41766ebcd8.webm?t=1747706032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use precious resources to craft tools or barter for supplies\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all while racing against time to uncover the source of the catastrophe.</p>",
